---
// Full terms of use (the old page loaded nothing). Website terms; shipments are governed by each rate
// confirmation and bill of lading. Have it reviewed by counsel before publishing.
// Photo credits for the temporary stock photos are kept here so the site has only the pages it needs.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageBanner from '../components/PageBanner.astro';
import { company, fullAddress } from '../data/site';
import { photoCredits } from '../data/credits';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use | Good Idea Cargo"
  description="Terms for using goodideacargo.com, requesting quotes, applying to drive and receiving text messages from Good Idea Cargo LLC."
  current="legal"
>
  <PageBanner title="Terms of Use" />
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="legal">
      <p class="updated">Effective November 13, 2026</p>
      <p>These Terms of Use govern your use of {company.domain} (the "website"), operated by {company.legalName} ("Good Idea Cargo", "we", "us"). By using the website or submitting a form, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the website.</p>

      <h2>Quotes and shipments</h2>
      <p>Rates we give through the website, by phone, by text or by email are estimates based on the information you provide. A shipment is booked only when we confirm it in writing with a rate confirmation. Each shipment is governed by its rate confirmation, the bill of lading and applicable law, which take precedence over these terms. Final charges may change if the actual shipment differs from the details provided, for example in weight, dimensions, locations, dates, waiting time or accessorial services.</p>

      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p>You agree to provide accurate, current information in our forms and to use your own contact details. We handle your information as described in our <a href={url('privacy-policy/')}>Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Driver applications</h2>
      <p>Submitting an application does not create an offer of employment or a contract. Any engagement as a driver or owner-operator is subject to our qualification process, federal and state regulations, and a separate written agreement.</p>

      <h2>Text messaging terms</h2>
      <p>If you opt in to text messages, you agree to receive messages from Good Idea Cargo about your quote, shipment or application at the number you provided. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to cancel at any time; reply HELP for help or contact us at <a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phone}</a>. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Consent is not a condition of any purchase or application.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Do not use the website to submit false information, to send unlawful, harmful or unsolicited content, to interfere with its operation, or to access systems or data you are not allowed to access.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The website's text, design and the Good Idea Cargo name belong to Good Idea Cargo or are used with permission. Third-party photos are used under the licenses listed below. You may not copy or reuse website content for commercial purposes without our written permission.</p>

      <h2>Third-party links and services</h2>
      <p>The website may link to or use third-party services, such as maps, Facebook and Instagram. We are not responsible for their content or practices; their own terms apply.</p>

      <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>The website is provided "as is" and "as available". To the fullest extent the law allows, we disclaim all warranties about the website, including that it will be uninterrupted or error-free. Information on the website is general and may change without notice.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent the law allows, Good Idea Cargo is not liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages arising from your use of the website. Liability for loss of or damage to freight is governed by the shipment documents and applicable federal law, not by these terms.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Washington and applicable federal law. Disputes about the website will be brought in the state or federal courts located in King County, Washington.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. The effective date at the top shows when they last changed. Continued use of the website after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{company.legalName}<br />{fullAddress}<br />Phone: <a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phone}</a><br />Email: <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a></p>

      <h2 id="photo-credits">Photo credits</h2>
      <p>The photos on this website are temporary images from Wikimedia Commons, used until Good Idea Cargo's own photos are ready.</p>
      <ul>
        {photoCredits.map((c) => (
          <li><strong>{c.use}:</strong> "{c.file}" by {c.author}, <a href={c.licenseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{c.license}</a>, via <a href={c.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a>, cropped.</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
